      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The title rings a bell, but I cannot remember the author." data-hint="Use the clue as subject and preserve partial rather than complete recognition." data-fix="The title rings a bell, but the speaker cannot fully place it."><p class="quiz-question">1. Which sentence expresses partial recognition?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The title rings a bell, but I cannot remember the author.">The title rings a bell, but I cannot remember the author.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I ring the title because every author is certain.">I ring the title because every author is certain.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The title breaks an ice in my memory.">The title breaks an ice in my memory.</button></div></div>
